{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_mismatch_2.march","start_line":12,"start_col":10,"end_line":12,"end_col":13,"message":"`greet` needs console access, but `cap` is the full IO capability.","code":"cap_mismatch:IO.Console","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":12,"start_col":10,"end_line":12,"end_col":13,"text":"cap_narrow(cap)","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[{"file":"errors/cap_mismatch_2.march","start_line":12,"start_col":4,"end_line":12,"end_col":23,"message":"`greet` needs `Cap(IO.Console)`"},{"file":"errors/cap_mismatch_2.march","start_line":11,"start_col":10,"end_line":11,"end_col":13,"message":"`cap` was bound here as `Cap(IO)`"}],"notes":["`IO` contains `IO.Console`, but a capability is never narrowed implicitly.","help: pass `cap_narrow(cap)`, which narrows it to `Cap(IO.Console)`."],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
